4 days until @arc mainnet goes live, Sept 16.

The ecosystem map before day one. Bookmark this:

🟩 DeFi stack:

@synthra_finance — CEX-feel DEX: spot, perps, routing, portfolios
@lunya_io — full DeFi suite: swaps, LPs, launches, native USDC
@Xylonet_ — stablecoin hub: USDC/EURC swaps, vaults, payments
@TowerExchange — aggregator hunting best price across Arc liquidity
@Hinkal_protocol — privacy layer: confidential USDC transfers
@nexorafi — AI-agent rails: USDC payments, escrow, treasury
@ArcDEXScan — trading terminal: charts, screener, launcher

🟩 Launchpad wars (this is where trenchers eat):

@TollyLabs — locked USDC liq from block one
@minarafun — instant liq + anti-snipe
@arcpad_meme — memecoins, locked Uni USDC liq
@actfunxyz — experimental distribution model
@ubidotfun — v4 pad, fee-share to creators AND holders
@eve_dot_fun — locked liq, RWA angle coming
@circlewarp — bonding curve, cross-chain buys planned
@Archemistdotfun — anti-snipe + buybacks
@sashimidotfun — USDC curve, locked liq
@liftdotfun — Arc-native, straight to live market
@Ayooclub — fair launches + curves + Uni
@Arcanedotfi — curve into locked Uni liq
@rwarcdotfun — RWA-based markets
@Zyoradotfun — fresh pad, Orixa-backed
@flutchdotfun — bridge/swap/launch/stake in one

🟩 Radar:

@Orixaxyz — curated NFTs + launchpad
@OrixaDomains — .arc domains in USDC
@arclens_app — Arc project research tool
@Bigshortdotxyz — bet coins up or down
@Longdotsupply — memes meet tokenized stocks
@PlayMossling — build/craft/trade game

Watched RH chain from the sidelines? 

Arc is your second chance at day one. 

Do the homework now, not after the runners.

