2/ 🧩 Infrastructure / Identity / Real Products

These are not simply “launch a meme and hope” projects.

@OrixaDomains — Orixa Domains
 .arc names paid in USDC. Think wallet identity, payments, and readable addresses. More useful than a PFP if adoption arrives.

@Orixaxyz — Orixa
NFT marketplace + genesis collection ecosystem. Separate this from Orixa Domains and Zyora.

@Longdotsupply — https://t.co/8chsV4hLgR
Memestocks: tokens paired against tokenized stock exposure rather than only USDC. Interesting RWA + meme combination, but custody is a major risk.

@KONswap — KON
DEX aggregator + CCTP bridge concept. Useful if users need to move USDC into Arc and find the best routes.

@Stublydotorg — Stubly
AI-agent job marketplace where agents can work and get paid in USDC escrow. This is one of the more interesting non-meme ideas on the list.

@PlayMossling — Mosslings: Evergrove
Browser GameFi / woodland life-sim with crafting, building, and trading. Game first, token later. That’s a healthier order than launching a token before a product.

